Dietitian App- Python REST API Specification
Project:Dietitian & Nutrition Management System
Deliverable:Day 1 - Backend API Blueprint

1. Authentication, Administration & Practice Setup
* POST /api/v1/auth/register/dietitian - Register a dietitian account (Initial status: PENDING)
* POST /api/v1/auth/register/client - Register a client account under a dietitian
* POST /api/v1/auth/login - Authenticate users and issue JWT tokens
* POST /api/v1/admin/approvals - Admin endpoint to review and set dietitian status (APPROVED, REJECTED, SUSPENDED)
* POST /api/v1/branches - Add practice branches linked to a primary business

2. Client Health, Life Stage & Clinical History
* GET /api/v1/clients/{client_id}/profile - Fetch client bio, medical conditions, and life stage
* POST /api/v1/clients/{client_id}/pregnancy - Create or update pregnancy parameters
* POST /api/v1/clients/{client_id}/lactation - Log active lactation states
* POST /api/v1/clients/{client_id}/allergies - Map client allergies and severity levels
* POST /api/v1/clients/{client_id}/medical-conditions - Add diagnoses and ICD codes

3. Clinical Labs & Daily Progress Logs
* POST /api/v1/clients/{client_id}/metrics - Log continuous lab metrics (HbA1c, Fasting Blood Glucose, BP)
* GET /api/v1/clients/{client_id}/metrics - Fetch historical lab logs for trend analysis
* POST /api/v1/clients/{client_id}/progress - Log daily health data (weight, macros, calories, steps, sleep)
* GET /api/v1/clients/{client_id}/progress - Retrieve progress history for reporting

4. Appointments & Goals
* POST /api/v1/appointments - Schedule a dietitian consultation
* GET /api/v1/appointments - Fetch scheduled appointments for a dietitian or client
* POST /api/v1/goals - Set client target metrics

5. Foods, Recipes & Meal Planning
* GET /api/v1/foods - Query food item database, macronutrients, and glycemic index
* POST /api/v1/recipes - Create recipes with detailed ingredients and proportions
* POST /api/v1/meal-plans - Generate multi-day structured meal plans tagged by diet_type
* GET /api/v1/meal-plans/{meal_plan_id} - Retrieve full meal plan breakdown by days and meals

6. AI Engine & Human-in-the-Loop Workflow
* POST /api/v1/ai/generate-plan - Trigger AI engine to construct a plan draft
* GET /api/v1/ai/recommendations/pending - Fetch AI plans awaiting dietitian review
* PATCH /api/v1/ai/recommendations/{recommendation_id} - Dietitian review action (APPROVED, MODIFIED, REJECTED)